sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Platform Admin
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Controller as FeastOperator Controller<br/>controller-runtime
    participant Reconciler as ODH Reconciler Pipeline
    participant Kustomize as Kustomize Renderer
    participant AppNS as Applications Namespace

    Note over User,AppNS: Reconciliation Trigger Flow

    User->>K8s: Create/Update FeastOperator CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io/v1alpha1)
    K8s->>Controller: Watch event: FeastOperator CR changed
    Controller->>Reconciler: Start reconciliation pipeline

    Note over Reconciler: Action Pipeline Steps

    Reconciler->>Reconciler: 1. Initialize module state
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: 2. Check upgrade requirements
    Reconciler->>K8s: 3. Read platform ConfigMap<br/>(direct API read, not cached)
    K8s-->>Reconciler: Platform version info
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: 4. Set kustomize parameters
    Reconciler->>Kustomize: 5. Render manifests via kustomize
    Kustomize-->>Reconciler: Rendered Kubernetes manifests

    Reconciler->>K8s: 6. Deploy resources<br/>(Deployments, Services, RBAC, Jobs, etc.)
    K8s-->>Reconciler: Resources created/updated
    Reconciler->>K8s: 7. Report deployment status<br/>(Update FeastOperator status)
    Reconciler->>K8s: 8. Garbage collect stale resources

    Note over Controller,AppNS: External CRD Watch Flow

    K8s->>Controller: Watch event: FeatureStore CR (feast.dev) changed
    Controller->>Reconciler: Trigger re-reconciliation
    K8s->>Controller: Watch event: CRD (filtered by label) changed
    Controller->>Reconciler: Trigger re-reconciliation
    K8s->>Controller: Watch event: Platform ConfigMap changed
    Controller->>Reconciler: Trigger re-reconciliation

    Note over Controller,AppNS: Metrics & Health Flow

    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>ServiceMonitor
    participant Probes as kubelet

    Probes->>Controller: GET /healthz :8081<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    Controller-->>Probes: 200 OK (liveness)
    Probes->>Controller: GET /readyz :8081<br/>HTTP, No Auth
    Controller-->>Probes: 200 OK (readiness)
    Prom->>Controller: GET /metrics :8443<br/>HTTPS, TokenReview+SAR
    Controller-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Reconciler,K8s: Finalizer Cleanup Flow

    K8s->>Controller: FeastOperator CR deletion
    Controller->>Reconciler: Run finalizer
    Reconciler->>K8s: Delete ClusterRoles<br/>(no ownerRef GC for cluster-scoped)
    Reconciler->>K8s: Delete ClusterRoleBindings
    Reconciler->>K8s: Remove finalizer from CR
